<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Account</p><h1>Updates</h1><p>Order and account activity sent to your CampusBite account. New updates appear as live alerts while the app is open.</p></div><form method="post" action="<?= h(app_url('notifications.read')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">Mark all as read</button></form></div>
